# Per-key persisted glyph state — device-local, written at runtime. Not
# part of the source tree `make flash` syncs from, so its own
# `rsync --delete` wipes this on every reflash. See
# tasks/ongoing/0030-custom-glyph-upload-and-persistence.md.
firmware/glyph_state/

# driver/e2e scenario run logs — see driver/e2e/operator.go
driver/e2e/runs/*.jsonl

